ployment, housing, financial aid, and educational services. Inquiries regarding non-discrimination policies may be directed to the Institutional Equity Office . Current Labor Condition Applications (H-1B & E-3 Filings) Review any current notices of Labor Condition Applications (LCA) filed by the University of Oklahoma. LCAs are filed with, and certified by, the Department of Labor's Employment and Training Administration. LCAs provide notice that the university has filed an H-1B or E-3 petition for the employee holding the job title on the respective LCA form. Please note that these are NOT notices of job opportunity. Recruitment for these positions has ended and the positions have been filled. Find information about current job opportunities at the links above. For additional information on the LCA postings, contact the Office of Immigration Services (OIS). Tobacco Statement The University of Oklahoma has a Smoke and Tobacco Free Policy . No Tobacco or Drug use (including medical marijuana) is allowed on any university property. Presidential Statement You can review the President’s Statement of Commitment to Affirmative Action Related to Veteran Status and Disabilities and Equal Employment Opportunities on the University of Oklahoma’s Institutional Equity Office webpage. The University of Oklahoma Annual Security and Fire Safety Report The University of Oklahoma is committed to assisting all members of the OU community in providing for their own safety and security.  The Annual Security and Fire Safety Report contains information regarding campus security and personal safety including topics such as: crime prevention, fire safety, university police law enforcement authority, crime reporting policies, disciplinary procedures and other matters of importance related to security and safety on campus. The Annual Security and Fire Safety Report also contains information about crime statistics for the three previous calendar years concerning reported crimes that occurred on campus; in certain off-campus buildings or property owned or controlled by OU; and on public property within, or immediately adjacent to and accessible from the campus. To request a paper copy of the Annual Security and Fire Safety Report, visit the Student Affairs office on your campus. Contact Human Resources We serve the Norman, Oklahoma City, and Tulsa Campuses Accessibility Sustainability HIPAA OU Jobs Search Policies Legal Notices Copyright Resources And Offices OU Report It! Updated 9/11/2025 by Human Resources : HrTalent@ou.edu Candidate Details We use cookies to give you a customized experience such as job recommendations and to analyze our traffic.  Through the use of cookies, the University will know what’s working and what’s not.  That information is then used to keep our content fresh and relevant to You the user. You consent to our cookies if you click “I Accept.”  By clicking “I Accept” you agree to the use of the Privacy Policy , which includes the use of cookies.  If you click on “I Do Not Accept,” then we will not use cookies, but you may have a deteriorated user experience.  You can change your settings by click on the Settings link on the top right of the device. Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually only set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or filling in forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work. Performance Cookies These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our site. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the site. If you do not allow these cookie we will not know when you have visited our site, and will not be able to m